            <ArticleTitle>Tissue remodeling and angiogenesis in asthma: the role of the eosinophil.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>163-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/1753465808092281</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This review covers the role of eosinophils in asthma-associated tissue remodeling and angiogenesis focusing on angiogenesis which is a recently discovered feature of asthma. In addition, novel directions for eosinophil-targeted/angiogenesis-targeted pharmacological intervention are discussed as new approaches in the treatment of asthma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
